{"parse": {"title": "Explode Star", "pageid": 4441, "revid": 28941, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Explode Star</b>, added in <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 16</a>, is a reward obtained from reaching Room 100 in the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Infinity Castle (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSW5maW5pdHlfQ2FzdGxlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Infinity Castle</span> (9th Season).\n</p><p>As of 30/09/23, the day of <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Update 17</a>, and the end of Season 9, the Explode Star could be opened to receive <a href=\"/wiki/Bombietta\" title=\"Bombietta\">Bombietta.</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color:#FFC208;\">+Required to obtain a special unit...</span></li>\n<li><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color:#921296;\"><i>\"If you throw away your life in battle, where's the point in winning?!!\"</i></span></li>\n<li><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color:#fc4242;\">This Star is sealed with a powerful magic and cannot be opened yet...</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"container&#95;ChBox\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(115px,1fr)); grid-auto-flow: row; justify-items: center; list-style-type: none; grid-row-gap: 13px; font-size: 18px;border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #94949480, inset 0 0 20px 0px #96969633; margin: 0; padding: 13px; overflow: hidden;\"><dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Mythic)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bombietta\" title=\